{"id":913558,"title":"15｜让AI学会规划与反思：Sequential_Thinking工具","content":"本节课介绍了MCP Server广场smithery.ai、深度思考工具Sequential Thinking及其Docker部署方法。首先，smithery.ai是全球最大的MCP Server广场，收录超过3000个MCP Server，用户注册后可使用API key远程连接这些服务器。接着，重点介绍了Sequential Thinking工具，该工具通过结构化思维动态解决问题并进行反思，代码开源且简洁，核心在于提示词设计。提示词强调动态规划和反思性问题解决，适用于复杂问题分解与规划。演示了如何通过RooCode平台连接和使用Sequential Thinking工具，展示了多步骤思考过程。最后，讲解了使用Docker本地部署Sequential Thinking工具的方法，以解决数据安全和远程资源连接不稳定的问题。通过Docker部署，可以实现私有化部署，减少资源占用，并确保数据安全。课程总结了smithery.ai的功能、Sequential Thinking工具的使用及Docker部署的优势，并布置了课后作业，要求使用Sequential Thinking和联网搜索工具完成一份报告撰写。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":403216,"user_name":"药师","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1213258,"ip_address":"四川","ucode":"14BB054A38A2F0","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/83/4a/3e08427e.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1762336793,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":146492,"content":"其实就是提示词","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1943646,"ctime":1762400267,"ip_address":"山东","comment_id":403216,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101074901,"comment_content":"sequentialthinking这个mcp我看通过docker部署并不需要设置大模型，那么大模型是mcp client提供的么，那sequentialthinking内部就是相当于一系列的提示词而已么？","like_count":1,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1943646,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1d/a8/5e/791d0f5e.jpg","nickname":"最后的风之子","note":"","ucode":"45D5487480A5D2","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":673702,"discussion_content":"其实就是提示词","content_length":21,"likes_number":1,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1762400267,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"山东","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}